Implemented and committed **TabPFN payment-delay forecasting** as `bd448af`. The API now serves forecasts to financiers, auditors, and invoice-owning KOB─░s; Gemma receives the forecast in its risk-report context, and financier/KOB─░ invoice details show a probability-bar card. TabPFN 9.2.0 and its v2 weights installed successfully in the requested venv. The measured time-based holdout (160 train / 41 test) scored **4.36 days MAE** and **78.05% accuracy**, documented in `docs/FORECAST.md`. The requested suite passes: **26 passed**.

