ÔÜí [Can Zero-Shot Models Beat XGBoost and LightGBM?](https://dev.to/debabrot_bhuyan/can-zero-shot-models-beat-xgboost-and-lightgbm-468j) ­şæñ [@debabrot_bhuyan](https://dev.to/debabrot_bhuyan) ÔÇö Their measured comparisons reinforce reporting task-specific metrics and split methodology rather than presenting a single score as proof of general performance. ­şöù [Read Full Discussion on DEV](https://dev.to/debabrot_bhuyan/can-zero-shot-models-beat-xgboost-and-lightgbm-468j)

